flowchart TD
    A[Hotel signs up] --> B[Verify company, owner and property]
    B --> C[Invite staff and configure roles]
    C --> D[Select plan and optional AI modules]
    D --> E[Worthkind subscription checkout]
    E --> F{Verified payment and entitlement?}
    F -->|No or ambiguous| G[Pending or disabled, manual support still available]
    F -->|Yes| H[Activate subscription with usage limits]
    H --> I[Hotel reviews knowledge, domains and escalation]
    I --> J[Issue public widget ID, allowlisted install domain]
    J --> K[Hotel embeds widget or enables channel]
    K --> L[Guest starts request]
    L --> M{Agent enabled, within budget and policy?}
    M -->|No| N[Direct form or human staff queue]
    M -->|Yes| O[Approved hotel knowledge and scoped agent]
    O --> P{Needs privileged action?}
    P -->|No| Q[Answer with cited hotel knowledge or abstain]
    P -->|Yes| R[Validate identity, role, explicit guest confirmation]
    R --> S[Typed backend domain handler]
    S --> T{Authoritative PMS, PSP or staff outcome?}
    T -->|Confirmed| U[Record verified business outcome]
    T -->|Unknown or failed| V[Open human or finance exception]
    G --> N
    Q --> W[Meter idempotent usage and observe]
    U --> W
    V --> W
    N --> X[Claim, acknowledge and resolve with staff]
    X --> Y[Transactional audit plus outbox]
    W --> Y
    Y --> Z[Owner dashboard, alerts, billing and cost]
    Z --> AA{Renewed, cancelled or cap reached?}
    AA -->|Renewed| H
    AA -->|Cancelled or cap reached| G
